child_workflow_hash.description:
The workflow the child froze, by hash: which version of it ran.
Reading the parent again never resolves the child's workflow anew;
the child's own manifest is its record.

oneOf.description:
Back to `node`, which runs again before the gate asks again;
`resumes` when its session picks the work back up with what the
person says.

ScopeCheckedPayload.description:
`task_id` is present for a task's scope check within a loop node;
absent for a node-level scope check — either way the envelope's own
`node_id` already names the node, so it is not repeated here.
